  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MatrixOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to the Matrix open protocol (used by Element, Synapse, etc.). Maps Matrix users to OASIS Avatars and room events (messages) to OASIS Holons. Supports any homeserver via MATRIX_HOMESERVER env var. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- feat: add 6 new OASIS providers — BlueSky, Matrix, Filecoin, Algorand, Ceramic, Basechain (b2e78ba)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Social/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MatrixOASIS",
